  "notes": "The HTML provided is from the homepage. Listing URLs were extracted from the main navigation. Product listing and detail field selectors are based on common patterns observed in e-commerce sites, assuming a similar structure for listing and detail pages.",
  "_llm_model": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
